     A* Select and omit specifications: S and O in column 17.
     A* Member: LFSELOM   Compilable: yes (given PERSON)
     A* Source: IBM i 7.5 DDS for physical and logical files,
     A*   select/omit keyword entries. Retrieved: 2026-07-25
     A*
00010A          R PERSFMT                   PFILE(PERSON)
00020A            PERSONID
00030A            AGE
00040A            STATE
00050A            SALARY
00060A          K PERSONID
     A*
     A* COMP compares a field to a value. Every valid relational
     A* operator appears below.
00070A          S AGE                       COMP(EQ 30)
00080A          S AGE                       COMP(NE 30)
00090A          S AGE                       COMP(LT 30)
00100A          S AGE                       COMP(NL 30)
00110A          S AGE                       COMP(GT 30)
00120A          S AGE                       COMP(NG 30)
00130A          S AGE                       COMP(LE 30)
00140A          S AGE                       COMP(GE 30)
     A* CMP is an accepted synonym for COMP.
00150A          S AGE                       CMP(GT 21)
     A*
     A* RANGE selects values between two limits, inclusive.
00160A          S AGE                       RANGE(21 65)
     A* VALUES selects a list of discrete values.
00170A          S STATE                     VALUES('MN' 'WI' 'IA')
     A* ALL selects or omits every remaining record.
00180A          O SALARY                    COMP(GT 200000)
00190A          S                           ALL
     A*
     A* Comparison against a character literal, and against another
     A* field rather than a constant.
00200A          S STATE                     COMP(EQ 'MN')
00210A          O AGE                       COMP(LT 18)
